<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0362_R24_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh NO!\rI was undercover, and you made me in\ntwo seconds!\r... I’m just a out-of-town agent.\rNothin’ to see here, OK? Keep walkin’.\rI figured, cut the power, and it’s\nmass panic! Bad luck for the locals!\fCHAOS!\rThe mission is CLASSIFIED, so I can’t\ntell you NOTHIN’!\rBut! If you beat me, I’ll come clean\nand snitch. Deal?\fLet’s scrap! Hands where I can see\n’em!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0362_R24_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0362_R24_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, aight. I’ll snitch.\rI took the Machine Part. I stashed\nit in the Cerulean Block.\rRight by the pool floatie.\nCheck the Block.\rBut don’t sleep on me!\nThe Feds gon’ run up on you for this.\rMy partners from Johto comin’.\nThey want SMOKE.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0362_R24_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\rYou sayin’ WHAT? The Feds\ngot shut down? DEFUNDED?\rNah, bruh, NAH! What I’m supposed\nto do now? Who signin’ my checks?!\r...Aight.\rI’m goin’ back home.\nI’ma start my OWN Feds.\fWith blackjack! Case closed!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0362_R24_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Who is this guy in black?!\nComin’ between me and my girl...!\fI’m callin’ HR. Wait, wrong job.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0362_R24_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We FINALLY alone. You ain’t gon’\nbother us, right? RIGHT?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0362_R24_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Could you leave us alone?\rI’m buildin’ CHEMISTRY with her, and\nit’s FINALLY workin’. Three years.\fTHREE.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0362_R24_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wh...who you?\nYou ruinin’ the vibe. The VIBE.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0362_R24_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s wrong with that guy?\n“Cerulean...by the pool floatie”\fis the “Machine Part”?\fWhat was he TALKIN’ about?\fHe ruined our date, is what he did.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0362_R24_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just keep it movin’. Good looks.\nDon’t ruin the chemistry. It’s fragile.</language>
	</row>
</body>
